### Generation API walkthrough (VS Code REST Client)
### Run make dev, then execute the requests in order.
### For the 202/409 cases, start the API with KOI_OPENROUTER_API_KEY set to any nonempty test value.
### Item 2 only enqueues jobs; no provider request runs until the drafting worker is added.
### Requests use explicit cookies so user A and B stay separate.

@host = http://localhost:5173
@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1
@password = password1

### No session: 401 unauthorized
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/generations
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"prompts"}

### Create user A: 201
# @no-cookie-jar
# @name signupA
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"generation-a-{{$guid}}@example.com","password":"{{password}}"}

### Create A's brand: 201
# @no-cookie-jar
# @name createBrandA
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"name":"Northstar Metrics","domain":"northstar.example","country":"US","description":"Analytics for startup acquisition teams"}

### Capability: 200, aiDrafting true with a configured key and enqueue client
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/capabilities
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Invalid JSON: 400 invalid_json
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

not-json

### Invalid mode: 400 validation, field mode/invalid
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"unknown"}

### Invalid key: 400 validation, field idempotency_key/invalid
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: bad key
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"prompts"}

### Enqueue prompts: 202 queued with id, mode, state, status_url
# @no-cookie-jar
# @name draftPrompts
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-prompts-1
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"prompts"}

### Same key and mode: 202 with the same run ID
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-prompts-1
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"prompts"}

### Same active mode with another key: 202 with the same run ID
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: another-prompts-key
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"prompts"}

### Reuse the original key for another mode: 409 idempotency_conflict
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-prompts-1
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"competitors"}

### Incompatible active mode: 409 generation_conflict with error.status_url
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"competitors"}

### Read status: 200; internal snapshot, job ID, key, and model are absent
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{host}}{{draftPrompts.response.body.$.status_url}}
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Recent runs: 200, paginated response with one queued item
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations?page=1&pageSize=10
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Invalid page size: 400 validation, field pageSize/invalid
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations?pageSize=101
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Missing run: 404 not_found
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Create user B: 201
# @no-cookie-jar
# @name signupB
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"generation-b-{{$guid}}@example.com","password":"{{password}}"}

### B cannot read A's run: 404 not_found
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{host}}{{draftPrompts.response.body.$.status_url}}
Cookie: {{signupB.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### B cannot enqueue for A's brand: 404 not_found
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{signupB.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"initial"}

### To test 503: remove KOI_OPENROUTER_API_KEY from .env/environment, restart the API, then run this request.
### Expected: 503 feature_unavailable; GET status and manual CRUD still work.
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands/{{createBrandA.response.body.$.id}}/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{signupA.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{"mode":"prompts"}

### Terminal key replay (200) and initial_already_completed (409) need a completed worker run in item 3.
